The Shogoth believed that one day we would find them and help them break free. I hope they are at peace!

Commander Derik reported that the Black Specters are taking over the Shogoth's empty bodies, and their leader has taken Yagditha's body. The Aquarians want revenge. The possessed Yagditha has started a violent battle.
The water people have united behind Zarad as their new leader.
I must exorcise Yagditha. I will take the Jewel of Life.
Help me by taking the Magic Prison to the Abyss of the Sea.

[Challenge Objective]

Take the Magic Prison and defeat Yagditha in the Abyss of the Sea.
When you are done, talk to Sage Celina in Pillai.
